{"nodes": [{"id": "src_help_dj_libraries_article", "label": "DJ libraries (help article)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "src/help/dj-libraries.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Help for importing, following and syncing DJ app libraries; Engine DJ two-way sync is paused."}, {"id": "src_help_dj_libraries_import", "label": "Importing a DJ library", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/dj-libraries.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Found libraries are listed under DJ libraries found; + Import takes a file by hand. Engine DJ keeps a database per drive and GLUE reads them together as one library."}, {"id": "src_help_dj_libraries_live_follow", "label": "Live following through GLUE Home", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/dj-libraries.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With GLUE Home running, it follows the libraries within seconds even with no GLUE tab open; the browser alone uses Refresh."}, {"id": "src_help_dj_libraries_main_library", "label": "Main DJ library", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/dj-libraries.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its beat grids and cues become every song's by default; what GLUE sets still comes first. It is the library GLUE keeps in step both ways."}, {"id": "src_help_dj_libraries_engine_dj_paused", "label": "Engine DJ two-way sync (paused)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/dj-libraries.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Paused since November 2026: after Engine DJ 5.3 rebuilt its library, GLUE took the rebuilt library for changes and removed pl